; xxh3 — the 128-bit XXH3 hash incremental.ComputeHash asks for
; (xxh3.HashString128), ported from the reference's dependency
; github.com/zeebo/xxh3 v1.1.0 (hash128.go, utils.go, consts.go and the scalar
; accumulator of accum_generic.go), which carries this notice:
